### 3. `src/products.js` — replaces `mod_res.tbl` + restore files

This is the heart of the framework. Each entry is a **Product Suite** — a named, groupable visualization configuration that knows which data source it needs and exactly how to render it. This is the direct analog of a NMAP2 restore file registered in `mod_res.tbl`.

```javascript name=src/products.js
